  "text": "Special\nOffers\n\nNeed a closer look? Buy a sample\nColor\n\nIron Ore\nDark Charcoal with Light Gray Throughout\n\nIron Ore Wall Cap\n48\" x 10\"\n\nHome Faux Stone Panels Iron Ore Iron Ore Wall Cap\nDesigned with an 8-inch void running lengthwise, the GenStone Wall Cap fits perfectly on top of a cinder block wall or any surface 8 inches wide or less. The Wall Cap can be attached with adhesive in an “S” pattern in the void and fasteners in the top of the cap. The fastener holes can be concealed easily with our eXact Match caulking and a paint kit. Other common uses include fences and half walls along with any GenStone stacked stone style.\n\n$ 99.99 each\n\n- Iron Ore Wall Cap quantity +\nAdd to cart\n\nCalculator Project SOS\n\n+100 pictures\n\nGet everything you need\n\nGuides & Downloads\n\nReviews\nProduct Knowledge\nSpecs",
